{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>And it was like gad seed, white.</b> An herb whose name is קול\"יינדר, and its seed is round and not white — and the manna was white. It is not compared to gad seed except for the matter of roundness: it was like gad seed — and it was white." "<b>Like צפיחת.</b> A dough that they fry in honey, and they call it אִסְקְרִיטִין in the language of the Mishnah (Pesachim 37) — and this is the Targum of Onkelos."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:45.896809125Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}